{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45430","headline":"红楼院应制 · 广宣","name":"红楼院应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红楼疑见白毫光，寺逼宸居福盛唐。\n支遁爱山情谩切，昙摩泛海路空长。\n经声夜息闻天语，鑪气晨飘接御香。\n谁道此中难可到，自怜深院得徊翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}